OL,3,GNorth West
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FSunday will start rather cloudy
OL,6,Fwith patches of fog and rural frost,
OL,7,Fand even the odd spot of light rain in
OL,8,Fplaces. Skies will gradually brighten
OL,9,Fduring the morning though, leaving
OL,10,Fsunny spells and isolated showers in
OL,11,Fthe afternoon.
OL,12,
OL,13,CTonight:FAny showers will die out in
OL,14,Fthe evening, leaving a dry start to
OL,15,Fthe night with clear spells. Patches
OL,16,Fof fog and frost forming overnight,
OL,17,Fthe fog locally dense.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
