OL,3,GNorth West
OL,4,
OL,5,CMonday:FFog and frost should gradually
OL,6,Fclear again on Monday morning with
OL,7,Fsome sunshine breaking through into
OL,8,Fthe afternoon. An easterly breeze
OL,9,Fdeveloping later on in the day.
OL,10,
OL,11,COutlook for Tuesday to Thursday:
OL,12,FTurning cloudy with rain arriving from
OL,13,Fthe south on Tuesday, accompanied by a
OL,14,Fsoutheasterly breeze. Further rain on
OL,15,FWednesday, then sunnier, but feeling
OL,16,Fcolder on Thursday.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
